 ### Conditional publication admission
 
+The source-test-only OC-10 capture selector `PRISMPM_OC10_CAPTURE_ROUTE`
+admits `image-owned-v1` (also the absent default) and `candidate-source-v1`.
+Unknown values refuse before execution; failures never fall back. Only the
+owning capture invocation and complete workspace-test child select the latter,
+and ambient overrides refuse. An SDK child executes the original test body.
