+binds the independently owned complete source/fixture union, six authority
+members, actual ELF/listing, unchanged SDK distribution/inventory and original
+capture tree. Python-compatible canonical JSON uses sorted keys, ASCII escapes
+and one final LF; source rows use UTF-8 byte order and Unicode scalar paths.
+The pre-envelope tree hash excludes only that envelope; the outer owner retains
+and rechecks the complete tree including it, avoiding a circular digest.
+Mount, image-config, inspection/stage barriers, retirement and EOF fields are
+privately retained process observations, not cryptographic daemon attestations.
+Separate bounded candidate diagnostics remain outside the accepted capture
+tree; forwarded stdout/stderr do not assert complete diagnostic retention.
+These test controls preserve `complete_application_accepted=false` and confer
+no production admission, source-free compiler runtime, malicious-daemon
+isolation, universal arithmetic or multi-architecture qualification.
